@SerilogOtelApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5242

### Health Check - Simple endpoint to verify API is running
GET {{SerilogOtelApi_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Data Items - Demonstrates structured logging and tracing
GET {{SerilogOtelApi_HostAddress}}/api/data
Accept: application/json

###

### Create Data Item - Demonstrates structured logging with request destructuring
POST {{SerilogOtelApi_HostAddress}}/api/data
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Item",
  "category": "Demo"
}

###

### External Service Call - Demonstrates W3C Trace Context propagation
# This endpoint calls httpbin.org and shows how trace context is propagated
GET {{SerilogOtelApi_HostAddress}}/api/external
Accept: application/json

###

### Trigger Error - Demonstrates error handling, tracing, and LogContext usage
# This endpoint intentionally throws an exception and showcases Serilog LogContext
# for enriching all logs within a scope with contextual properties (UserId, RequestId, OperationType)
GET {{SerilogOtelApi_HostAddress}}/api/error
Accept: application/json

###
